# ==========================================
# 🛑 PROJECT-SPECIFIC DATA & MODEL PROTECTION
# ==========================================
# Keeps your heavy model binaries and training tables out of Git.
# Render will pull these files directly from your repository branch, 
# so if you WANT them deployed, keep them tracked. 
# UNCOMMENT (remove the #) below IF you choose to host files elsewhere:
# api/data/*.csv
# api/models/*.pkl